   "synthesis": "**High-frequency permanent core**\n1. Blockchain/Web3/NFT/tokenization.\n2. AI → ML → DL → LLM capability hierarchy.\n3. Cyber security primitives: malware, digital signature/certificate/PKI.\n4. Quantum: qubit, superposition/decoherence vocabulary, NQM.\n5. IoT/wearables + connected-device logic.\n6. SaaS/cloud service model.\n7. 3D printing/additive manufacturing.\n8. AR/VR/metaverse.\n9. Biometrics + storage basics.\n10. UPPCS hardware/memory fundamentals.\n\n**Question style**\n- UPSC repeatedly tests **properties, exceptions and comparative statements**, not definitions alone.\n- Elimination hinges on absolute claims: “only”, “all data”, “unbiased”, “one metre”, “voice-only”, “data-only”, “central bank tracked”.\n- Dynamic examples should be used only to anchor a durable concept."
  },
